References: <_jkLq33gyAg.QgbktXn5dmAJ@aroma-affymetrix.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/aroma-affymetrix/c/_jkLq33gyAg/m/h3wxrY_vmsMJ>
